<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-FENERBAHCE VS JUVENTUS TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FENERBAHCE VS JUVENTUS TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's European Cup match between Fenerbahce of Turkey and Juventus of Italy in group C of the Champions' League:</p>
<p>Fenerbahce: 1-Recber Rustu; 2-Yagcioglu Ilker; 3-Okechukwu Uche, 4-Jes Hogh, 5-Senturk Kemalettin, 6-Kara Halil Ibrahim, 8-Akgun Tuncay, 9-Elvir Bolic, 10-Jay Jay Okocha, 16-Uygun Bulent, 19-Dasgun Tarik</p>
<p>Juventus: 12-Michelangelo Rampulla; 2-Ciro Ferrara, 4-Paolo Montero, 5-Sergio Porrini, 8-Antonio Conte, 9-Alen Boksic, 10-Alessandro Del Piero, 14-Didier Deschamps, 15-Christian Vieri, 21-Zinedine Zidane, 22-Gianluca Pessotto</p>
<p>Referee: Serge Muhmenthaler (Switzerland)</p>
</text>
